{%- comment -%}
  Site-local bibliography hook.

  `al_folio_core`'s `_layouts/bib.liquid` includes this file (its only
  documented extension point) right before it assembles the `.periodical`
  line, so `entrytype` can still be rewritten here.

  For @inproceedings / @incollection the gem renders `<em>In {{ booktitle }}</em>`.
  Our booktitles already read "Proceedings of ..." / "Findings of ...", so the
  forced "In " prefix is redundant — drop it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign entrytype = entrytype | replace: '<em>In ', '<em>' -%}
